+
+> Best AI tools for restaurants in 2026 are increasingly open source, composable, and practical. This list focuses only on public GitHub repositories that restaurants, operators, agencies, and developers can actually inspect, fork, self-host, or adapt for menu ingestion, conversational ordering, recommendations, review analysis, and forecasting.
